.TH QUIPU-SIGNER-DISABLE 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-signer\-disable \- Disable signer enforcement
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu signer disable\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Disable signer enforcement
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
